**Suggested Remediation**

{% block remediation -%}
[Programs vary on whether they want a remediation suggestion. For
detection-class findings (exposed config files, default credentials,
exposed admin panels), the remediation is usually obvious and a single
sentence ("remove from public access" / "rotate the disclosed credential"
/ "place behind authentication") is sufficient. For exploitation-class
findings (RCE, deserialization, SSRF), defer to the program's security
team unless you have specific patch-level knowledge.]
{%- endblock %}

